BODY structure_inspection_cover
MATERIAL casing_alloy
SKETCH cover_layout ON PLANE XY
SHAPE outer CLOSED ROLE STOCK
POINT p0 0 mm 0 mm FIXED
POINT p1 90 mm 0 mm FIXED
POINT p2 90 mm 90 mm FIXED
POINT p3 0 mm 90 mm FIXED
LINE bottom FROM p0 TO p1
LINE right FROM p1 TO p2
LINE top FROM p2 TO p3
LINE left FROM p3 TO p0
END
SHAPE hole_1 CLOSED ROLE HOLE
POINT c 5 mm 5 mm FIXED
CIRCLE rim CENTER c RADIUS flange_hole_radius
END
SHAPE hole_2 CLOSED ROLE HOLE
POINT c 75 mm 5 mm FIXED
CIRCLE rim CENTER c RADIUS flange_hole_radius
END
SHAPE hole_3 CLOSED ROLE HOLE
POINT c 75 mm 75 mm FIXED
CIRCLE rim CENTER c RADIUS flange_hole_radius
END
SHAPE hole_4 CLOSED ROLE HOLE
POINT c 5 mm 75 mm FIXED
CIRCLE rim CENTER c RADIUS flange_hole_radius
END
REGION cover_with_holes
OUTER outer
HOLES hole_1 hole_2 hole_3 hole_4
END
SOLVE FULL
END
PAD cover_plate FROM cover_layout.cover_with_holes DEPTH 6 mm NEW
END

POSE structure_inspection_cover AT cover_origin ROTATION 0 deg 0 deg 0 deg
