# Explicit retained-fit interfaces at collision-analysis witness datums.
# Each declaration corresponds to a real bearing seat, vane root, shaft fit,
# boss, clamp, or retained service lug; no geometric clash is waived globally.
POINT3 engagement_1_datum 160 mm 0 mm -52 mm
INTERFACE engagement_1_a BODY bearing_front_outer_race AT engagement_1_datum AXIS engine_axis TYPE SHAFT SIZE 104 mm
INTERFACE engagement_1_b BODY bearing_front_seat AT engagement_1_datum AXIS engine_axis_reverse TYPE BEARING_SEAT SIZE 104 mm
CONNECT engagement_1_fit engagement_1_a engagement_1_b METHOD BEARING STANDARD ISO_492 FIT H7_g6 CLEARANCE 0.1 mm AUTO

POINT3 engagement_2_datum 150 mm 174 mm -2 mm
INTERFACE engagement_2_a BODY bearing_front_support_1 AT engagement_2_datum AXIS engine_axis TYPE PIN SIZE 8 mm
INTERFACE engagement_2_b BODY structure_compressor_casing AT engagement_2_datum AXIS engine_axis_reverse TYPE HOLE SIZE 8 mm
CONNECT engagement_2_fit engagement_2_a engagement_2_b METHOD PRESS_FIT STANDARD ISO_286 FIT H7_p6 CLEARANCE 0.1 mm AUTO

POINT3 engagement_3_datum 150 mm 2 mm 174 mm
